Package: saunacost
Type: Package
Title: Dollars-Per-Session Math for a Home Sauna or Cold Plunge
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("James", "Verlander", email = "scrapertweeter3@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: James Verlander <scrapertweeter3@gmail.com>
Description: A home sauna is priced by sticker and judged by vibe; this
    package prices it by the session. sauna_cost() amortizes the gear over
    the sessions you actually take, adds the electricity line most buyers
    skip, and prints the visit count where the gear finally beats paying
    per visit elsewhere - or says plainly when usage never closes the gap.
    Companion to the protocol-cost writing on HackedSelf
    <https://hackedself.com>.
